# Keep Source/, Config/, Content/, Docs/, Build/ and *.uproject.
# Keep plugin descriptors, source, content and resources.
# Do not ignore *.dll or *.lib globally: JSBSim's required libraries live in
# Plugins/JSBSimFlightDynamicsModel/Source/ThirdParty/JSBSim/Lib/.
# The copy staged into a Binaries/ directory is generated and remains ignored.
